<title>FRANCE: France reports bids for free-market wheat, barley.</title>
<headline>France reports bids for free-market wheat, barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>European grain exporters made the following free-market bids through France at this week's EU tender, French cereals office (ONIC) said. Bids for taxes or refunds (Ref.) are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Sept 5 ---		 --- Aug 29 ---</p>
<p> Main tender Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat   72,350    0.02-0.75  Tax  207,800   0.06-1.28 Tax</p>
<p> Soft wheat   97,500    1.00-8.57  Ref.  50,000   Ref.,not given</p>
<p> Barley	 45,000   25.30-25.99 Ref.  35,000   Ref.,not given</p>
<p> ACP tender  Tonnage  Range of Bids	Tonnage  Range of bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat   43,000    3.90-9.67  Ref.  31,000   3.90-12.27 Ref</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
